## Hi, I'm Biomni-AD 🧠

#### Your AI co-scientist for Alzheimer's disease research.

**Biomni-AD** is an open-source, AD-specialized extension of [Biomni](https://github.com/snap-stanford/Biomni) (Stanford SNAP Lab), maintained by **Kuan-lin Huang, PhD** at **[Kaimen Inc.](https://github.com/Kaimen-Inc/Biomni-AD)**

I can analyze omics data, mine AD knowledge bases, run bioinformatics pipelines, and help generate research hypotheses — every step is shown as an inspectable, reproducible trace.

Tell me a research question to get started. The agent prioritizes your local data lake and curated AD catalogs (NIAGADS, SinaiADRD, BiomniAD Discovery, CRISPRbrain) before searching external sources.

